+    <string name="dahi_vi_note_sound_echo">起伏鏗鏘、聲紋層疊：多線疊浪聲紋   ★★★★☆</string>
+    <string name="dahi_vi_note_raging_wave">澎湃洶湧、大海無量：模糊海浪流體噪波   ★★★★★</string>
