+    <string name="dahi_keymap_title">Keyboard mapping commands (custom keys)</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_summary">Two steps: (1) declare the command once under preset_keys; (2) in preset_keyboards, attach that name to a key (long_click, click, swipe_up … all work).\n\nThe name declared in step 1 is the name you reference in step 2.</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_voice">Voice input toggle</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_voice_desc">1) Under preset_keys add:\nKeyboard_voice: { label: Voice, command: voice_toggle }\n2) In preset_keyboards, on the key you want:\nlong_click: Keyboard_voice\n(enable ASRKB voice first)</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_floating">Floating keyboard</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_floating_desc">1) Under preset_keys add:\nKeyboard_floating: { label: Float, command: floating_keyboard }\n2) In preset_keyboards, on the key you want:\nlong_click: Keyboard_floating</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_recent">Recently used words</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_recent_desc">1) Under preset_keys add:\nKeyboard_recent: { label: Recent, command: recent_words }\n2) In preset_keyboards, on the key you want:\nlong_click: Keyboard_recent</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_stats">Input statistics</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_stats_desc">1) Under preset_keys add:\nKeyboard_stats: { label: Stats, command: open_input_stats }\n2) In preset_keyboards, on the key you want:\nlong_click: Keyboard_stats</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_builtin">Other commands provided by the theme</string>
+    <string name="dahi_keymap_builtin_desc">Same two steps, just change command: liquid_keyboard (symbols / emoji), clipboard_window (clipboard), menu_keyboard (schema menu), set_color_scheme / set_theme (colour scheme / theme).</string>
