+    <string name="dahi_candidate_bar_swipe_unroll_summary">When on, the unroll button on the right of the candidate bar is hidden so the space goes to candidates: swipe down to unroll, swipe up at the top of the list to collapse. Holding still still opens the long-press menu. Off by default</string>
+    <string name="dahi_candidate_labels">Show index numbers in the keyboard candidate bar</string>
+    <string name="dahi_candidate_labels_summary">When floating candidates are turned off, the keyboard candidate bar still shows numbers 1, 2, 3… so you can commit candidates quickly with the number keys</string>
