+    <string name="dahi_candidate_label_superscript_summary">Draw 1, 2, 3… at the top-left corner of the candidate text (smaller and faded), so each item is 6–8dp narrower and one or two more fit on screen. Turn off to restore the usual "1 candidate" style. Applies to both the keyboard candidate bar and floating candidates.</string>
